  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Textual Rig Console — Slice 3: DashboardScreen",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Status",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Draft.** Composes existing widgets into a projection-driven dashboard screen with header, activity (session pane + evidence rail side-by-side), and footer zones.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Why DashboardScreen",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The `SessionPaneWidget` and `EvidenceRailWidget` are individual cards. The `DashboardScreen` composes them into a single operator surface:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **OperatorHeaderWidget** — title, subtitle, safety-state badge - **Activity zone** — `SessionPaneWidget` (left) + `EvidenceRailWidget` (right) - **FooterStatusWidget** — footer hint + backlog items (capped at 5)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This is the first multi-widget screen in the Rig Console. It demonstrates how projections flow through a screen hierarchy: `DashboardProjection` → `DashboardScreen` → child widgets via `update_projection()`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "DashboardProjection Fields",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-9",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Field",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`title`",
          "str",
          "Dashboard title"
        ],
        [
          "`subtitle`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "Optional subtitle"
        ],
        [
          "`session`",
          "`SessionPaneProjection`",
          "Session state for the pane"
        ],
        [
          "`evidence`",
          "`EvidenceRailProjection`",
          "Evidence state for the rail"
        ],
        [
          "`safety_state`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "Safety badge label (e.g. \"active\")"
        ],
        [
          "`footer_hint`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "Footer hint text (e.g. \"q: quit r: refresh\")"
        ],
        [
          "`backlog_items`",
          "list[str]",
          "Pending items (capped at 5 in display)"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Properties",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-11",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Property",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`backlog_capped`",
          "list[str]",
          "Backlog items capped at `_DASHBOARD_BACKLOG_CAP` (5)"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "What the model explicitly does NOT contain",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- No `stdout`, `stderr`, or output fields - No file contents or snippets - No diffs or old/new text - No command transcripts - No secrets or tokens - No raw tool results",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "OperatorHeaderWidget",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Renders the dashboard header from a `DashboardProjection`:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Title** — bold text 2. **Subtitle** — muted, shown if present 3. **Safety badge** — \"⚡ {safety_state}\", shown if present",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Subclasses `Horizontal`. Has `update_projection(DashboardProjection)`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "FooterStatusWidget",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Renders the dashboard footer from a `DashboardProjection`:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Hint** — muted footer hint text, shown if present 2. **Backlog** — \"backlog:\" header + capped items, or \"no backlog\" empty state",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Subclasses `Vertical`. Has `update_projection(DashboardProjection)`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "DashboardScreen",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A `Screen` subclass composing:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-24",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "┌─ OperatorHeaderWidget ───────────────────────┐\n├─ Horizontal ─────────────────────────────────┤\n│  SessionPaneWidget  |  EvidenceRailWidget    │\n├─ FooterStatusWidget ─────────────────────────┘",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `DEFAULT_CSS` sets background `#06110B`, side-by-side widgets at 50% width - `BINDINGS`: `q` → quit, `r` → refresh placeholder - `update_projection(DashboardProjection)` propagates to all child widgets - `action_refresh()` calls `_render_all()` (placeholder for future live updates)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Projection flow",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-27",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "DashboardProjection\n├── title / subtitle / safety_state → OperatorHeaderWidget\n├── session → SessionPaneWidget\n├── evidence → EvidenceRailWidget\n└── footer_hint / backlog_items → FooterStatusWidget",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "EvidenceRailWidget Updates in Slice 3",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Added `Updated` Message class (matching `SessionPaneWidget` pattern) - Added `update_projection(EvidenceRailProjection)` method - Added `_render_all()` pattern using `_update_static()` for header, counts, items - Refactored `compose()` to yield a single `.evidence-rail-items` Static for content",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-30",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Project Structure",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-31",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "vibe/cli/textual_ui/rig_console/\n├── __init__.py              # Public API re-exports (new: DashboardProjection, DashboardScreen, etc.)\n├── projections.py           # +DashboardProjection, +_DASHBOARD_BACKLOG_CAP\n├── console_app.py           # +DashboardScreen preview mode\n├── screens/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   └── dashboard.py         # DashboardScreen (NEW)\n└── widgets/\n    ├── __init__.py\n    ├── session_pane.py\n    ├── evidence_rail.py     # +update_projection(), +Updated Message\n    ├── operator_header.py   # OperatorHeaderWidget (NEW)\n    └── footer_status.py     # FooterStatusWidget (NEW)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-32",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Tests",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-33",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "tests/cli/textual_ui/rig_console/\n├── __init__.py\n├── test_session_pane_projection.py\n├── test_session_pane_widget.py\n├── test_evidence_rail.py\n├── test_dashboard_projection.py   # DashboardProjection model tests (NEW)\n├── test_dashboard_screen.py        # DashboardScreen structural tests (NEW)\n├── test_operator_header.py         # OperatorHeaderWidget tests (NEW)\n└── test_footer_status.py           # FooterStatusWidget tests (NEW)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Next Slices",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-35",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Slice",
        "Component",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "4",
          "Action boundary",
          "Provider protocol, typed read-only actions, keybinding seam ✅ Completed"
        ],
        [
          "5",
          "Runtime adapter",
          "Replace fixture provider with real backend adapter"
        ],
        [
          "6",
          "Multi-session grid",
          "Grid of SessionPaneWidget instances for fleet/delegate views"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What DashboardScreen intentionally does NOT do",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Does not modify VibeApp or any TCSS files - Does not read raw tool output, logs, files, or diffs - Does not handle real-time updates (projection feed is a future slice) - Does not wire into the default CLI (standalone preview only) - Does not implement session lifecycle controls - Does not implement full screen navigation (no screen stack yet)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-38",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Standalone Preview",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-39",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "bash",
      "content": "uv run python -m vibe.cli.textual_ui.rig_console.console_app",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Default mode is `\"dashboard\"` which shows the `DashboardScreen` with sample data. Pass `mode=\"single\"` to see individual widgets:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-41",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "app = RigConsolePreview(mode=\"single\")",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
